  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Release\n\n      - Cryptographically secure passcode generation.\n      - Numeric, alphabetic, and alphanumeric passcodes.\n      - Custom character set support.\n      - Formatted voucher code generation.\n      - Secure random integer generation.\n      - Efficient string construction using string.Create().\n      - Multi-targeting support for netstandard2.1, net6.0, net8.0, and net10.0.",
